---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="SDK"
  description="The Lumen plugin SDK: interfaces, event bus and model registry."
  lang="en"
  altHref="/sdk/"
>
  <h1>SDK</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Lumen is built around a public plugin SDK: anyone can write a new module following the same
    interfaces the official modules use.
  </p>

  <p>
    Full documentation, examples, and the contributor guide live directly in the SDK repository,
    not duplicated here:
  </p>

  <p>
    <a href="https://github.com/lumen-assistive/lumen-sdk">github.com/lumen-assistive/lumen-sdk</a>
  </p>

  <p>
    The reference implementation of these contracts lives in
    <a href="https://github.com/lumen-assistive/lumen-core">lumen-core</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
